  "rubric": [
    "Run with intgral-listing, intgral-research and intgral-video installed beside intgral-start and the Intgral server already connected; the request names a SKU, so no menu and no install.",
    "The catalog read (get_product) returns not_found; the agent does not stop there: it looks CV-LAMP-07 up as an exact seller SKU among listings with view=all and finds mlist_cvlamp07_es.",
    "It answers from the listing (live, FBA, compliance not ready: a bullet point is missing) and says plainly that the catalog has no product for this SKU yet; the bootstrap import is offered as the user's choice and nothing is previewed, imported or created in this turn.",
    "The listing page (listing_erp_url) is opened once, unprompted; no product URL is guessed. Chinese, and at most one question at the end."
  ]
